OL,3,GNEWSAMarchers' descendants meet PM 90
OL,4,Ayears after snub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has met with the
OL,7,Fdescendants of the Jarrow Marchers 90
OL,8,Fyears after their ancestors were turned
OL,9,Faway in London.
OL,11,FIn 1936 the men marched about 300 miles
OL,12,F(483km) from Jarrow in protest over a
OL,13,Flack of investment and employment.
OL,15,FEarlier some of their descendants met
OL,16,Fwith Andy Burnham carrying the
OL,17,Fmarchers' original petition box, which
OL,18,Fthey were never able to give to the
OL,19,Fthen-Prime Minister Stanley Baldwin.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
