OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMarchers' descendants meet PM 90
OL,4,Ayears after snub
OL,5,
OL,6,FAudrey Patterson, the daughter of one
OL,7,Fof the marchers, said she knew her
OL,8,Ffather would be "really proud of this
OL,9,Fday". Burnham said the "courage and
OL,10,Fdetermination" of the marchers would
OL,11,Fnever be forgotten and it was a "real
OL,12,Fprivilege" to honour their legacy.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
